<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eleven stocks fell, five rose and three were flat in a 27.5-million-zloty turnover in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday, with the WIG 20 index flat at 1,880.1 points.</p>
<p>The remaining three stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 0.9 percent in a 17.6-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
